dialogueText = Array[String](["Here you are! Do you see these paintings? I dislike them too… that’s why I can help you wreck them. I bet there is also something that you’ll need behind them.", "Are you serious?", "Indeed I am. These paintings look frail enough, maybe cut them? Or... if you find something that I could help you heat up, we could burn them!", "That's interesting... I'll be back soon... hehe..."])
